      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Issuing a statement supporting the bill is a risk, as it may alienate your older customer base, but it's a necessary move to show you're not ignoring the concerns of your younger demographic. On the other hand, staying neutral will likely be seen as a cop-out, and your brand's reputation will suffer from being perceived as out of touch. The pros of supporting the bill include increased brand loyalty among younger customers, while the cons include potential backlash from older customers.",
